{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object seen, approach it. If at object, take it, check properties, do task, then move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectSeen    /> <Condition ID = IsAtObject    />\"",
